guide butler-routes-completionist/stonetalon-mountains
title Stonetalon Mountains - Completionist
levels 16-30
zone Stonetalon Mountains
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step The north border - Albagorm's vale

  note In from Ashenvale along the north road: Keeper Albagorm holds the border post. Quests here run 16 to 30, with the Desolace-border finales up to 40 - the steps say which legs belong to which level.
  accept 1057 -- Reclaiming the Charred Vale - Keeper Albagorm; Bloodfury harpies, west
  note 1057's pre (1056, Journey to Stonetalon Peak) lives in the Ashenvale guide - take 1057 after that leg.
  note Innkeeper Faralia binds here, at the north post.
  buy 4470 "Simple Wood"
  buy 4471 "Flint and Tinder"
  note Chylina sells the wood and the flint for the Firepit rekindling below - buy both now.

step Stonetalon Peak - Gaxim and Kaela

  note The Peak is the Alliance hub: Gaxim Rustfizzle and Kaela Shadowspear hold the terrace, Ziz Fizziks and Veenix the lower huts.
  accept 1085 -- On Guard in Stonetalon - Kaela Shadowspear; Gaxim Rustfizzle takes it
  note 1085's pre (1070, On Guard in Stonetalon) lives in the Ashenvale guide - take 1085 after that leg.
  turnin 1085 -- On Guard in Stonetalon - Kaela's word to Gaxim Rustfizzle
  accept 1071 -- A Gnome's Respite - Gaxim Rustfizzle; Venture Co. loggers, east
  note 1071's pre (1085 above) fills here - take 1071 after it.
  accept 1079 -- Covert Ops - Alpha - Gaxim Rustfizzle; the Engineering Plans, east
  note 1079's pres (1074 in Ironforge, 1077 in Stormwind) live in the city guides - take 1079 after those legs.
  accept 1080 -- Covert Ops - Beta - Gaxim Rustfizzle; the Venture Co. Letters, east
  note 1080's pres (1074, 1077 above) fill the same way - take 1080 after those legs.
  note The Covert Ops kit (Pack, Plans, Detonators, Explosives) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  accept 2931 -- Castpipe's Task - Gaxim Rustfizzle; Master Mechanic Castpipe takes it in Ironforge

step Stonetalon Peak - Ziz and Veenix

  accept 78270 only Rogue -- Goblin Lockpicks - Veenix; a Venture Co. Work Order, east
  accept 1093 -- Super Reaper 6000 - Ziz Fizziks; the Blueprints, east
  note 1093's pre (1483, Ziz Fizziks) accepts in the Barrens - take 1093 on its own.
  accept 1096 -- Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle - Ziz Fizziks; his Mechanical Arm, north-east
  note 1096's pre (1095, Further Instructions) accepts in the Barrens - take 1096 on its own.

step The Peak - writ: leggings (Blacksmithing)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  goto 58.99,62.6
  accept 94225 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Rough Bronze Leggings - Ziz Fizziks; back to Ziz, at 60
  note 94225's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94225 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Rough Bronze Leggings - back to Ziz Fizziks

step The Peak - writ: goggles (Engineering)

  when skill Engineering 1

  goto 58.99,62.6
  accept 94234 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Shadow Goggles - Ziz Fizziks; back to Ziz, at 60
  note 94234's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94234 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Shadow Goggles - back to Ziz Fizziks

step The Peak - writ: quiver (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  goto 58.99,62.6
  accept 94243 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Heavy Quiver - Ziz Fizziks; back to Ziz, at 60
  note 94243's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  note A bought Heavy Quiver also fills this writ - Marda Weller in Stormwind and Thalgus Thunderfist in Ironforge sell it; buy one on the city legs below.

step The Peak - writ: boots (Tailoring)

  when skill Tailoring 1

  goto 58.99,62.6
  accept 94252 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Red Woolen Boots - Ziz Fizziks; back to Ziz, at 60
  note 94252's starter (the writ) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 94252 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Red Woolen Boots - back to Ziz Fizziks

step Windshear - Piznik's orders

  accept 1090 -- Gerenzo's Orders - Piznik; kill Piznik
  complete 1090 @71.87,60 era -- Piznik for Piznik
  turnin 1090 -- Gerenzo's Orders - back to Piznik
  accept 1092 -- Gerenzo's Orders - Piznik; Ziz Fizziks takes it
  note 1092's pre (1090 above) fills here - take 1092 after it.
  note 1092's starter (the Unidentified Ore) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 1092 -- Gerenzo's Orders - Piznik's word to Ziz Fizziks

step Windshear Crag - Covert Ops

  complete 1071 @64,53 era -- Venture Co. Loggers for Gaxim Rustfizzle
  complete 1071 @65,54 era -- Venture Co. Deforesters for Gaxim Rustfizzle
  turnin 1071 -- A Gnome's Respite - back to Gaxim Rustfizzle
  complete 1079 @66.09,51.33 era -- the Engineering Plans off the plans hut for Gaxim Rustfizzle
  turnin 1079 -- Covert Ops - Alpha - the plans to Gaxim Rustfizzle
  complete 1080 @74.46,59.3 era -- the Venture Co. Letters off the documents hut for Gaxim Rustfizzle
  turnin 1080 -- Covert Ops - Beta - the letters to Gaxim Rustfizzle
  accept 1091 -- Kaela's Update - Gaxim Rustfizzle; Kaela Shadowspear takes it, with the Letters
  note 1091's pres (1079, 1080 above) fill here - take 1091 after them.
  note 1091 names the Venture Co. Letters - the documents hut east has more if your bags are short.
  turnin 1091 -- Kaela's Update - back to Kaela Shadowspear
  complete 78270 only Rogue @66.69,52.33 era -- a Venture Co. Work Order off the Windshear crews for Veenix
  turnin 78270 only Rogue -- Goblin Lockpicks - the order to Veenix
  complete 1093 @67,52 era -- the Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints off a Venture Co. Operator for Ziz Fizziks
  turnin 1093 -- Super Reaper 6000 - back to Ziz Fizziks
  accept 78149 -- Fury of the Land - the Scrolls, south-east; Garion Wendell takes it in Stormwind
  note 78149's objective (Fury of the Land) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  complete 78149 @74.4,85.7 era -- Fury of the Land for Garion Wendell; it names no source in the data, so have it in your bags

step The Charred Vale - harpies and embers

  accept 1083 -- Enraged Spirits - Kaela Shadowspear; Smoldering Embers, south-west
  note 1083's pre (1091) fills at Windshear - take 1083 after it.
  accept 1084 -- Wounded Ancients - Kaela Shadowspear; Corroded Shrapnel, south-west
  note 1084's pre (1091) fills at Windshear - take 1084 after it.
  complete 1057 @33.36,64.99 era -- Bloodfury harpies for Keeper Albagorm
  complete 1057 @32.07,60.43 era -- Bloodfury ambushers for Keeper Albagorm
  complete 1057 @32.66,67.44 era -- Bloodfury slayers for Keeper Albagorm
  complete 1057 @34.69,68.03 era -- Bloodfury rogues for Keeper Albagorm
  complete 1083 @35,66 era -- Smoldering Embers off the flame spirits for Kaela Shadowspear
  complete 1084 @32,66 era -- Corroded Shrapnel off the charred ancients for Kaela Shadowspear

step The Peak, returned - Kaela's update

  turnin 1083 -- Enraged Spirits - back to Kaela Shadowspear
  turnin 1084 -- Wounded Ancients - back to Kaela Shadowspear
  accept 1072 -- An Old Colleague - Gaxim Rustfizzle; Lomac Gearstrip takes it in Ironforge
  note 1072's pre (1071) fills at Windshear - take 1072 after it.
  accept 1075 -- A Scroll from Mauren - Gaxim Rustfizzle; Collin Mauren takes it in Stormwind
  note 1075's pre (1071) fills at Windshear - take 1075 after it.
  accept 1082 -- Update for Sentinel Thenysil - Kaela Shadowspear; Thenysil takes it in Ashenvale
  note 1082's pres (1083, 1084 above) fill here - take 1082 after them.
  complete 1096 @64.49,40.25 era -- Gerenzo's Mechanical Arm off Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle for Ziz Fizziks
  turnin 1096 -- Gerenzo Wrenchwhistle - back to Ziz Fizziks
  accept 1094 -- Further Instructions - Ziz Fizziks; Sputtervalve takes it in the Barrens
  note 1094's pre (1093 above) fills at Windshear - take 1094 after it.

step The center - courier, pridewings and the firepit

  accept 86574 -- Stonetalon Supply Run - Night Elf Courier; a Supply Bundle off the pridewings, Faralia takes it
  complete 86574 @50.41,45.39 era -- a Stonetalon Supply Bundle off the pridewings for Innkeeper Faralia
  accept 79980 -- Scramble - the Pocket Litter, central
  note 79980's listed pre (79192, Stepping Stones) has no start anywhere in the data - take 79980 on its own.
  turnin 79980 -- Scramble - the litter's word to the Mound of Dirt
  accept 79974 -- Wet Job - the Mound of Dirt; the Carved Figurine takes it, in Loch Modan
  note 79974's pre (79980 above) fills here - take 79974 after it.
  accept 80001 -- Rekindle - the Firepit; Simple Wood and Flint and Tinder, bought above
  complete 80001 @40.61,52.41 era -- Simple Wood and Flint and Tinder for the Firepit; bought from Chylina above, have them in your bags
  turnin 80001 -- Rekindle - the rekindled Firepit

step The north road, returned

  turnin 1057 -- Reclaiming the Charred Vale - back to Keeper Albagorm
  accept 1059 -- Reclaiming the Charred Vale - Keeper Albagorm; Falfindel Waywarder takes it, south
  note 1059's pre (1057 above) fills here - take 1059 after it.
  turnin 86574 -- Stonetalon Supply Run - the bundle to Innkeeper Faralia

step The south camp - Kreldig's stand

  note The south camp holds the Desolace-border chains: Kreldig Ungor, Vahlarriel Demonslayer, Captain Pentigast and Corporal Melkins. Innkeeper Lyshaerya binds here.
  accept 1458 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - Kreldig Ungor; Hatefury claws and horns, here
  note 1458's pre (1453, Reclaimers' Business in Desolace) lives in the Ironforge guide - take 1458 after that leg.
  accept 1454 -- The Karnitol Shipwreck - Kreldig Ungor; Karnitol's Chest takes it, Desolace
  note 1454's pre (1453 above) fills the same way - take 1454 after that leg.
  accept 1456 -- The Karnitol Shipwreck - Kreldig Ungor; Karnitol's Satchel off the Slitherblades, Desolace coast
  note 1456's pre (1455, from Karnitol's Chest below) is uncontracted in Desolace - take 1456 on its own.
  accept 1459 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - Kreldig Ungor; venom and kodo hide, here and Desolace
  note 1459's pre (1458 above) fills here - take 1459 after it.
  accept 1466 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - Kreldig Ungor; demon bits, Desolace south
  note 1466's pre (1459 above) fills here - take 1466 after it.
  accept 1437 -- Vahlarriel's Search - Vahlarriel Demonslayer; the Malem Chest takes it, Desolace
  accept 1438 -- Vahlarriel's Search - Vahlarriel Demonslayer; Dalinda Malem takes it, Desolace
  note 1438's pre (1465, from the Malem Chest below) is uncontracted in Desolace - take 1438 on its own.
  accept 1382 -- Strange Alliance - Captain Pentigast; Uthek the Wise takes it, Desolace
  accept 1385 -- Brutal Politics - Captain Pentigast; Warug takes it, Desolace
  accept 1387 -- Centaur Bounty - Corporal Melkins; centaur ears, Desolace
  complete 1458 @50,87 era -- Hatefury Claws off the Hatefury for Kreldig Ungor
  complete 1458 @50,87 era -- Hatefury Horns off the Hatefury for Kreldig Ungor
  complete 1459 @33,83 era -- Scorpashi Venom off the snapper for Kreldig Ungor

step Expedition - Desolace, the northern chests

  zone map 1443
  turnin 1437 -- Vahlarriel's Search - Vahlarriel's word to the Malem Chest
  note The Malem Chest offers 1465 (Vahlarriel's Search) - take it and turn it back in to Vahlarriel; 1438 follows.
  turnin 1454 -- The Karnitol Shipwreck - Kreldig's word to Karnitol's Chest
  note Karnitol's Chest offers 1455 (The Karnitol Shipwreck) - take it and turn it back in to Kreldig; 1456 follows.
  complete 1456 @31,12 era -- Karnitol's Satchel off the Slitherblades for Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1438 -- Vahlarriel's Search - Vahlarriel's word to Dalinda Malem
  zone map 1442

step Expedition - Desolace, the southern coves

  zone map 1443
  turnin 1382 -- Strange Alliance - Pentigast's word to Uthek the Wise
  turnin 1385 -- Brutal Politics - Pentigast's word to Warug
  complete 1387 @70,46 era -- Centaur Ears off the Kolkar for Corporal Melkins
  complete 1459 @49,41 era -- an Aged Kodo Hide for Kreldig Ungor
  complete 1466 @52,68 era -- Felhound Brains for Kreldig Ungor
  complete 1466 @50,77 era -- Nether Wings for Kreldig Ungor
  complete 1466 @51,83 era -- Doomwarder Blood for Kreldig Ungor
  zone map 1442

step The south camp, returned

  turnin 1458 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - claws and horns to Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1459 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - venom and hide to Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1466 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - demon bits to Kreldig Ungor
  accept 1467 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - Kreldig Ungor; Roetten Stonehammer takes it in Ironforge
  note 1467's pre (1466 above) fills here - take 1467 after it.
  note 1467's starter (Leftwitch's Package) has no placed source in the data - have it in your bags.
  turnin 1456 -- The Karnitol Shipwreck - the satchel to Kreldig Ungor
  accept 1457 -- The Karnitol Shipwreck - Kreldig Ungor; Roetten Stonehammer takes it in Ironforge, with the Satchel
  note 1457's pre (1456 above) fills here - take 1457 after it.
  note 1457 takes the Satchel to Roetten - the Slitherblades above drop more.
  turnin 1387 -- Centaur Bounty - the ears to Corporal Melkins

