  zone map 1455
  turnin 1072 -- An Old Colleague - Gaxim's word to Lomac Gearstrip
  turnin 2931 -- Castpipe's Task - Gaxim's word to Master Mechanic Castpipe
  turnin 1457 -- The Karnitol Shipwreck - Kreldig's word to Roetten Stonehammer
  turnin 1467 -- Reagents for Reclaimers Inc. - Kreldig's word to Roetten Stonehammer
  zone map 1442

