  note Marda Weller sells the Heavy Quiver for the Peak writ - buy one for Ziz.
  turnin 78149 -- Fury of the Land - the Scrolls' word to Garion Wendell
  zone map 1442

step Expedition - Barrens, Sputtervalve's word

  zone map 1413
  turnin 1094 -- Further Instructions - Ziz's word to Sputtervalve
  zone map 1442

step Expedition - Ashenvale, Thenysil's word

  zone map 1440
  turnin 1082 -- Update for Sentinel Thenysil - Kaela's word to Sentinel Thenysil
  zone map 1442

step Expedition - Feralas, Falfindel's word

  zone map 1444
  turnin 1059 -- Reclaiming the Charred Vale - Albagorm's word to Falfindel Waywarder
  note Falfindel wanders - she also appears in Thousand Needles; this turn-in uses her Feralas camp.
  zone map 1442

step Expedition - Loch Modan, the figurine

  zone map 1432
  turnin 79974 -- Wet Job - the Mound's word to the Carved Figurine
  note The Figurine offers the Eagle's Fist chain (level 32, Stonetalon pre-quest) - bank it for later.
  zone map 1442

step The Peak, home

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  turnin 94243 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Heavy Quiver - the bought quiver to Ziz Fizziks
